  "upstream": {
    "sceneModes": "Nonzero mode excludes kinematic-static or both-kinematic non-trigger pairs unless the corresponding body-core override bit is present; zero bypasses that exclusion. Kinematic-static tests bit9; both-kinematic accepts bit8 on either body. Other body/joint exclusions remain separate.",
    "bodyFlags": "The dynamic constructor embeds the SCB at the reviewed public offset, whose constructor embeds the core; the sum of those offsets plus coreFlags equals the public getter committed-flags field. The pair path consumes that core field directly, while the public getter may select buffered flags. Saved public flags are not borrowed into an unobserved pair.",
    "postShader": "For two body cores with bit0 set, the ordinary pair path clears pairFlags bit0 after the shader, when result bits0/1 are clear. Shader flags alone cannot prove solving.",
    "callback": "The selected shader only returns 0 or 2 and never requests pairCallback bit2; a nonzero notification callback is a separate report-dispatch condition."
  },
